{"uid":"8bc9035843e7f189","name":"test_unsettled_steering_at_verified_defers_once_through_the_declared_edge","fullName":"tests.test_worker_hat#test_unsettled_steering_at_verified_defers_once_through_the_declared_edge","historyId":"ad7736965c7320951a782bf906048032","time":{"start":1791956459052,"stop":1791956459067,"duration":15},"description":"The pre-013 mechanism looped IN PLACE: it discarded the VERIFIED\n    verdict, dispatched a no-task `worker` iteration from inside\n    `_step_review` itself and re-reviewed, over and over, until\n    `pending_steering()` came back empty -- the dispatch loop never saw a\n    state change at all. Task 013 replaces that with `_terminal_success_\n    blockers()` and a single return through the declared\n    `steering_pending_at_verified` edge: exactly ONE review iteration runs,\n    no worker iteration is dispatched from here, and the run does not go\n    terminal.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The pre-013 mechanism looped IN PLACE: it discarded the VERIFIED<br />\nverdict, dispatched a no-task <code>worker</code> iteration from inside<br />\n<code>_step_review</code> itself and re-reviewed, over and over, until<br />\n<code>pending_steering()</code> came back empty -- the dispatch loop never saw a<br />\nstate change at all. Task 013 replaces that with <code>_terminal_success_ blockers()</code> and a single return through the declared<br />\n<code>steering_pending_at_verified</code> edge: exactly ONE review iteration runs,<br />\nno worker iteration is dispatched from here, and the run does not go<br />\nterminal.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791956453364,"stop":1791956453364,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp